Third-party code used by FalloutMP
==================================

Dependencies are installed by vcpkg (vcpkg.json at the repository root and
fallout4-platform/plugin/vcpkg.json). Each port has its own license and
copyright; vcpkg copies them next to the installed packages
(build/vcpkg_installed/<triplet>/share/<port>/copyright).

The F4SE plugin (fallout4-platform/plugin) is built on CommonLibF4
(https://github.com/libxse/commonlibf4, MIT license), fetched at build time
at the commit pinned in fallout4-platform/plugin/CMakeLists.txt.

